        } else if let Some(artist_dir) = album_staging.parent() {
            prune_empty_dir(artist_dir);
        }
    }
```
Careful: the original was `if matches!(destination, DownloadDestination::Library(_))`. Replacing with `if let` is fine. But `destination` is used later for `destination.render()` — need a borrow, not a move. `if let DownloadDestination::Library(dir) = &destination` ✓ borrows.

And `is_the_same_dir`:
```rust
/// True when two paths name the same existing directory. The staging layout
/// mirrors the library layout, so a staging root inside a library root makes an
/// album's staging path and its library destination the same directory; the
